; ISSUE-002: an unquote can't appear inside colon type sugar in a template.
; Expected: compiles; `p:&~name` in a quasiquote names the type the macro was given.
; Actual: unknown type: ~name (the whole atom is read before unquote applies).
; fixed-when: compiles
(defstruct Pt x:i32)
(defmacro getter (name) `(defn get-x (p:&~name):i32 (p 'x)))
(getter Pt)
(defn main ():i32 (get-x (Pt 0)))
